# VITE_API_BASE_URL is baked in at build time.
#
# On Vercel, set this in Project Settings → Environment Variables to:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
#
# The /api path is rewritten to the AWS ALB by vercel.json (keeps the browser
# on HTTPS and avoids mixed-content errors). If you deploy the backend on a
# HTTPS domain, you can point this directly at that origin instead.
